Worked for 15s

Module 1.4 — Object Initialization

Complete Question Bank

I’ll use the same fixed flow you selected for Modules 1.1–1.3:

> Basic → Intermediate → Advanced → Major Traps → Design → Debugging Challenges → Production → Senior/Interview → Final Mastery Test



This follows the actual Module 1.4 syllabus, whose goal is to master this, super, constructors, initialization blocks, inheritance ordering, JVM class initialization, edge cases and production implications. 


